{"seq":3,"slug":"container-image-testing","title":"容器镜像测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/tools-frameworks/container-image-testing","wordCount":1230,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"容器镜像测试\">容器镜像测试</h1><p>容器镜像是现代基础设施的原子交付单元。一个镜像中包含操作系统包、语言运行时、应用依赖和配置文件——每一层都可能引入已知漏洞、许可证违规或安全反模式。容器镜像测试不是可选的安全加分项，而是供应链安全的基本要求：未经扫描的镜像等同于未经编译检查的代码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>漏洞扫描</strong>：对比镜像中的包与 CVE 数据库，识别已知安全缺陷</li>\n<li><strong>双引擎策略</strong>：Trivy + Grype 交叉验证，降低漏报率</li>\n<li><strong>SBOM（软件物料清单）</strong>：镜像内所有组件的机器可读清单（CycloneDX/SPDX）</li>\n<li><strong>镜像签名</strong>：Cosign/Notation 确保镜像完整性和来源可验证</li>\n<li><strong>EPSS 评分</strong>：基于利用概率的漏洞优先级排序，超越纯 CVSS 严重度</li>\n<li><strong>供应链安全</strong>：从构建到部署的完整信任链验证</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"镜像测试的三个维度\">镜像测试的三个维度</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>验证内容</th>\n<th>典型工具</th>\n<th>阻断阈值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>漏洞扫描</td>\n<td>已知 CVE（OS 包 + 应用依赖）</td>\n<td>Trivy、Grype、Docker Scout</td>\n<td>CRITICAL 或 HIGH</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规检查</td>\n<td>构建最佳实践、CIS 基准</td>\n<td>Dockle、Hadolint、Trivy config</td>\n<td>失败条目 &gt; 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应链验证</td>\n<td>SBOM 完整性、签名链</td>\n<td>Syft、Cosign、Notation</td>\n<td>签名无效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"漏洞扫描-trivy-与-grype-的双引擎策略\">漏洞扫描：Trivy 与 Grype 的双引擎策略</h2><p>单一扫描器有漏报风险——不同工具使用不同的漏洞数据库和检测启发式。2026 年的最佳实践是双引擎扫描：Trivy 作为主扫描器覆盖 OS 包和应用依赖，Grype 作为补充扫描器交叉验证。</p>\n<h3 id=\"trivy-全能型扫描器\">Trivy：全能型扫描器</h3><p>Trivy（Aqua Security 维护）支持扫描容器镜像、文件系统、Git 仓库和 Kubernetes 集群：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 基础镜像扫描&#10;trivy image myapp:latest&#10;&#10;# 按严重等级过滤，CRITICAL 时返回非零退出码&#10;trivy image --exit-code 1 --severity CRITICAL myapp:latest&#10;&#10;# 输出 JSON 供后续处理&#10;trivy image --format json --output results.json myapp:latest&#10;&#10;# 扫描 Dockerfile 的配置问题&#10;trivy config ./Dockerfile&#10;&#10;# 忽略无修复版本的漏洞（减少噪音）&#10;trivy image --ignore-unfixed myapp:latest\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 基础镜像扫描</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">trivy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> image</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 按严重等级过滤，CRITICAL 时返回非零退出码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">trivy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> image</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --exit-code</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --severity</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> CRITICAL</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出 JSON 供后续处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">trivy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> image</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --format</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> json</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --output</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> results.json</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 扫描 Dockerfile 的配置问题</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">trivy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./Dockerfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 忽略无修复版本的漏洞（减少噪音）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">trivy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> image</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --ignore-unfixed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp:latest</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"grype-依赖级深度分析\">Grype：依赖级深度分析</h3><p>Grype（Anchore 维护）特别擅长对 distroless 等包元数据稀疏的镜像进行深度依赖分析：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 扫描镜像&#10;grype myapp:latest&#10;&#10;# 指定失败阈值&#10;grype myapp:latest --fail-on high&#10;&#10;# 基于 SBOM 扫描（而非直接扫描镜像）&#10;syft myapp:latest -o cyclonedx-json &gt; sbom.json&#10;grype sbom:sbom.json\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 扫描镜像</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">grype</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 指定失败阈值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">grype</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp:latest</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --fail-on</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> high</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 基于 SBOM 扫描（而非直接扫描镜像）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">syft</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp:latest</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cyclonedx-json</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sbom.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">grype</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sbom:sbom.json</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"扫描器对比\">扫描器对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Trivy</th>\n<th>Grype</th>\n<th>Docker Scout</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据库更新</td>\n<td>自动（启动时）</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>离线支持</td>\n<td>支持（本地 DB 缓存）</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SBOM 生成</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>需配合 Syft</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置扫描</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>许可证检查</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开源</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否（免费层）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"sbom-生成与供应链安全\">SBOM 生成与供应链安全</h2><p>软件物料清单（SBOM）是镜像内所有组件的机器可读清单。2026 年主要的 SBOM 格式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CycloneDX</strong>：安全审计导向，结构紧凑</li>\n<li><strong>SPDX</strong>：许可证合规导向，Linux Foundation 标准</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[构建镜像] --&gt; B[Syft 生成 SBOM]&#10;    B --&gt; C[SBOM CycloneDX/SPDX]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Grype 基于 SBOM 扫描]&#10;    C --&gt; E[许可证合规检查]&#10;    D --&gt; F{漏洞?}&#10;    F --&gt;|CRITICAL| G[阻断发布]&#10;    F --&gt;|无| H[Cosign 签名]&#10;    H --&gt; I[推送到 Registry]\">graph LR\n    A[构建镜像] --&gt; B[Syft 生成 SBOM]\n    B --&gt; C[SBOM CycloneDX/SPDX]\n    C --&gt; D[Grype 基于 SBOM 扫描]\n    C --&gt; E[许可证合规检查]\n    D --&gt; F{漏洞?}\n    F --&gt;|CRITICAL| G[阻断发布]\n    F --&gt;|无| H[Cosign 签名]\n    H --&gt; I[推送到 Registry]</pre><p>SBOM 的核心价值在于：当新的 CVE 发布时，无需重新扫描所有镜像——只需在 SBOM 数据库中查询哪些镜像包含受影响的组件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"镜像构建的安全最佳实践\">镜像构建的安全最佳实践</h2><p>漏洞扫描是事后补救，更有效的策略是在构建阶段减少攻击面：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实践</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多阶段构建</td>\n<td>最终镜像不含构建工具</td>\n<td><code>FROM golang AS build</code> → <code>FROM distroless</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Distroless 基础镜像</td>\n<td>CVE 表面积极小（2-20MB）</td>\n<td><code>gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非 root 运行</td>\n<td>降低容器逃逸风险</td>\n<td><code>USER nonroot:nonroot</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可复现构建</td>\n<td>SBOM 有意义（同源同产出）</td>\n<td><code>-trimpath -ldflags=&quot;-buildid=&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定基础镜像版本</td>\n<td>避免隐式升级引入漏洞</td>\n<td><code>FROM node:20.12.0-slim</code>（非 <code>node:latest</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ci-cd-中的镜像测试管道\">CI/CD 中的镜像测试管道</h2><p>完整的镜像安全管道包含构建时扫描、签名和准入控制三个阶段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/image-security.yml&#10;jobs:&#10;  build-and-scan:&#10;    steps:&#10;      - name: Build image&#10;        run: docker build -t myapp:${{ github.sha }} .&#10;&#10;      - name: Trivy scan (primary)&#10;        run: trivy image --exit-code 1 --severity CRITICAL,HIGH myapp:${{ github.sha }}&#10;&#10;      - name: Grype scan (secondary)&#10;        run: grype myapp:${{ github.sha }} --fail-on high&#10;&#10;      - name: Generate SBOM&#10;        run: syft myapp:${{ github.sha }} -o cyclonedx-json &gt; sbom.json&#10;&#10;      - name: Sign image&#10;        run: cosign sign --yes myapp:${{ github.sha }}&#10;&#10;      - name: Push to registry&#10;        run: docker push myapp:${{ github.sha }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/image-security.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  build-and-scan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Build image</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">docker build -t myapp:${{ github.sha }} .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Trivy scan (primary)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">trivy image --exit-code 1 --severity CRITICAL,HIGH myapp:${{ github.sha }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Grype scan (secondary)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">grype myapp:${{ github.sha }} --fail-on high</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Generate SBOM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">syft myapp:${{ github.sha }} -o cyclonedx-json > sbom.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Sign image</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cosign sign --yes myapp:${{ github.sha }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Push to registry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">docker push myapp:${{ github.sha }}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"epss-评分-漏洞优先级的量化决策\">EPSS 评分：漏洞优先级的量化决策</h2><p>并非所有 CRITICAL CVE 都需要立即修复。EPSS（Exploit Prediction Scoring System）提供漏洞被实际利用的概率评分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Priority = Severity_{CVSS} \\times P_{EPSS} \\times Exposure_{network}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">tw</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Severity_{CVSS}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：漏洞的 CVSS 基础分</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{EPSS}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：未来 30 天内被利用的概率（0-1）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Exposure_{network}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">tw</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：该组件是否暴露在网络边界（0 或 1）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>EPSS &gt; 0.1 且 CVSS &gt;= 7.0 的漏洞应优先修复；EPSS &lt; 0.01 的 CRITICAL 漏洞可以排入常规修复周期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"运行时持续扫描\">运行时持续扫描</h2><p>构建时扫描只捕获<em>当时</em>已知的漏洞。新的 CVE 不断发布，因此需要对已部署的镜像进行持续扫描：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Registry 级扫描</strong>：Harbor、ECR、ACR 内置定期重新扫描已存储镜像的能力</li>\n<li><strong>集群级扫描</strong>：Trivy Operator 在 Kubernetes 集群内持续扫描运行中的工作负载</li>\n<li><strong>准入控制</strong>：Kyverno / Gatekeeper 策略拒绝未签名或含 CRITICAL CVE 的镜像</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关于如何将扫描结果与合规框架对齐，参见 <a href=\"../integration-e2e/security-compliance-scanning\">安全合规扫描</a>。关于策略引擎在镜像准入中的应用，参见 <a href=\"policy-testing-opa-sentinel\">策略测试（OPA/Sentinel）</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>容器镜像测试覆盖漏洞扫描、合规检查和供应链验证三个维度。双引擎扫描（Trivy + Grype）降低漏报风险，SBOM 生成使新 CVE 发布时能快速定位受影响镜像，签名验证确保镜像从构建到部署的完整信任链。构建阶段的攻击面缩减（distroless、多阶段构建、非 root）配合运行时持续扫描，形成从左移预防到右移监控的完整安全闭环。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"容器镜像测试","id":"容器镜像测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"镜像测试的三个维度","id":"镜像测试的三个维度"},{"level":2,"text":"漏洞扫描：Trivy 与 Grype 的双引擎策略","id":"漏洞扫描-trivy-与-grype-的双引擎策略"},{"level":3,"text":"Trivy：全能型扫描器","id":"trivy-全能型扫描器"},{"level":3,"text":"Grype：依赖级深度分析","id":"grype-依赖级深度分析"},{"level":3,"text":"扫描器对比","id":"扫描器对比"},{"level":2,"text":"SBOM 生成与供应链安全","id":"sbom-生成与供应链安全"},{"level":2,"text":"镜像构建的安全最佳实践","id":"镜像构建的安全最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"CI/CD 中的镜像测试管道","id":"ci-cd-中的镜像测试管道"},{"level":2,"text":"EPSS 评分：漏洞优先级的量化决策","id":"epss-评分-漏洞优先级的量化决策"},{"level":2,"text":"运行时持续扫描","id":"运行时持续扫描"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"策略测试（OPA/Sentinel）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/tools-frameworks/policy-testing-opa-sentinel"},"next":{"title":"基础设施集成测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/integration-e2e/infrastructure-integration-tests"}}